        T["Increases attack power with both melee and ranged weapons, and improves the chance to score a critical hit with all weapons.|nIncreases armor and chance to dodge attacks."] = "Aumenta o poder de ataque de armas corpo a corpo e de longo alcance e a chance de acerto crítico com todas as armas.|nAumenta a armadura e a chance de se esquivar de ataques."
